                <mxCell id="706" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 2rem; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; caret-color: rgb(33, 37, 41); color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 17px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;&quot;&gt;Time‑to‑Card&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;reduzieren: In ≤3 Chat‑Turns zu einer druckfähigen Karte.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;&quot;&gt;Monetarisierung:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Freemium (Basis gratis), Premium‑Vorlagen/Branding via Abo, Affiliate‑Provision mit Druckpartnern, B2B‑Lizenzen.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;&quot;&gt;Zielgruppen:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Privatnutzer:innen (schnell &amp;amp; hübsch), KMU‑Marketing (CI‑konform, Serienproduktion).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
